cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FormalSLT, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FormalSLT: Formal Statistical Learning Theory in Lean 4"
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robert
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/FormalSLT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/FormalSLT"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of finite-sample statistical learning theory bounds,
  including ERM, Rademacher symmetrization, VC-style generalization,
  finite contraction, linear predictors, finite sub-Gaussian chaining,
  algorithmic stability, finite PAC-Bayes confidence bounds, and
  total-bounded Dudley boundary adapters.
